# ===== CMake 构建产物 =====
# 不含前导斜杠 = 匹配任意层级，故每个练习目录下的 build/ 都会被忽略
build/
cmake-build-*/
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
cmake_install.cmake
CTestTestfile.cmake
Testing/
install_manifest.txt

# ===== 编译中间产物与可执行文件 =====
*.o
*.obj
*.a
*.lib
*.so
*.dylib
*.dll
*.out
*.app
*.exe

# ===== IDE / 编辑器 =====
.vscode/
.idea/
.clangd/
.cache/
compile_commands.json
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ===== 操作系统 =====
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ===== 临时目录（不上传） =====
tmp/

# ===== 日志文件 =====
*.log

# ===== Redis 持久化数据（Docker 挂载目录） =====
code/stage07/7-3-redis/data/

# ===== 压测脚本临时产物（bench/run_bench.sh 生成）=====
# .server.out 由上面的 *.out 规则已覆盖，这里只补 strace/perf 采样产物
# *.data.old 是 perf 覆盖同名 .data 时自动留下的旧备份
**/bench/.strace.*.txt
**/bench/.perf.*.data
**/bench/.perf.*.data.old
